  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When I run \"ant -f configvalues.xml configOnWebServer\" to configure the",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lucene Demo, I get a repository.properties that has SOAPHOSTPORT as the",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "hostname / portnumber, instead of localhost:8080.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Delving into the configvalues.xml file and comparing it against the",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "repository.properties template, the problem seems to be that",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "configvalues.xml is substituting the host/port string for FEDORASOAP",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "instead of SOAPHOSTPORT. It is also trying to substitute the fedora user",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "and password, but they are hardwired in the template.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
